      ],
      "text": "Subscribers per 1,000 views read 0.6 on the latest finished read, against a typical 2.9. On E8, DesignerTom gained 26 subscribers (9.2 per 1,000 views); the Dive Club side managed 3.6 per 1,000.",
      "recommendation": "Test a spoken subscribe ask on both channels at a high-energy moment about halfway in, and pin the subscribe link in the DesignerTom chat. Compare per-1,000 rates by channel afterward."
    },
    {
      "id": "trim-early-exits",
      "category": "content",
      "serves": "audienceQuality",
      "factIds": [
        "drop-E9-12",
        "drop-E5-12",
        "drop-E4-9"
      ],
      "text": "Early exits cluster roughly a tenth to an eighth of the way in. Of every 100 viewers, 5.1 left in that stretch on E9, 5.4 on E5, and 4.6 on E4.",
      "recommendation": "Move long shout-outs, nominations and stories out of the first quarter-hour. Open with the guest or demo, and test whether more people stay past that point."
    },
    {
