      ],
      "text": "E5's launch ran soft: 1,127 YouTube views at its launch read, against a typical 1,751. Announce-to-play sits at 23.5 against a typical 28.8.",
      "recommendation": "Post the next announce on both channels and X a day or more ahead, with a short clip teaser. Test whether the first-week views reach the typical level."
    },
